                   Parameters for VARMAP
                   *********************
 
START OF PARAMETERS:
nscoreclus.dat                \file with data
1    4   5                    \   number of variables: column numbers
-1.0e21         1.0e21        \   trimming limits
0                             \1=regular grid, 0=scattered values
 50   50    1                 \if =1: nx,     ny,   nz
1.0  1.0  1.0                 \       xsiz, ysiz, zsiz
1   2   0                     \if =0: columns for x,y, z coordinates
check.dat                     \file for variogram output
 32    32     0               \nxlag, nylag, nzlag
1.0  1.0    1.0               \dxlag, dylag, dzlag
1       1    0                \xtol, ytol, ztol (in the dlag unit)
1                             \minimum number of pairs
0                             \standardize sill? (0=no, 1=yes)
1                             \number of variograms
1   1   4                     \tail, head, variogram type
